            printf("Options:\n");
            printf("-s resolution  Set the desired width and height for the video previews.\n");
            printf("-q quality      Specify the video encoding quality for the generated previews.\n");
            printf("-o output_dir   Redirect the output directory for saved previews instead of the current working directory.\n");
            printf("-f              Force overwrite existing previews if they already exist.\n");
            printf("-v              Enable verbose mode which prints each video being processed along with its duration and frame rate during conversion.\n");
            printf("-t thread_count Specify the number of threads to use for batch processing, with a default of 5 if not specified.\n");
